------------+------------
 SeqScan(o) | {oid,name}

EXPLAIN (COSTS off)
SELECT c.region, count(*)
  FROM customers c JOIN orders o ON o.customer_id = c.id
 WHERE o.order_date >= '2026-09-02' AND o.amount > 900
 GROUP BY c.region;
psql:customer_examples.sql:136: NOTICE:  gg_planman: applying hints "SeqScan(o)" id=421 key_base=1536521606010585085 key_oid=-6556977528910716802
                                                       QUERY PLAN                                                       
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 Gather Motion 3:1  (slice1; segments: 3)
   ->  Finalize HashAggregate
         Group Key: c.region
         ->  Redistribute Motion 3:3  (slice2; segments: 3)
               Hash Key: c.region
               ->  Streaming Partial HashAggregate
                     Group Key: c.region
                     ->  Hash Join
